WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.696
PROBLEM. Two people need to share a message.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.483
TECHNOLOGY. A phone helps them talk.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.589
MEASURE. A thermometer shows temperature.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.357
INVENT. A safe cardboard model solves a small problem.
